        <div class="ans"><p>Trust is earned, not promised. We're radically transparent — no jargon, no ticket-number treatment. You join a vetted peer group of Sydney business owners on the same journey, and if you ever feel overwhelmed, our life-design mentors help you navigate it. We only succeed when you feel confident, supported and profitable.</p></div>
      </div>
